@RestControllerAdvice
public class GlobalExceptionHandler {
    private static final Logger log = LoggerFactory.getLogger(GlobalExceptionHandler.class);

    @ExceptionHandler(OrderNotFoundException.class)
    public ResponseEntity<ErrorResponse> handle(OrderNotFoundException e) {
        log.error("Order not found", e); // the one and only log entry
        return ResponseEntity.notFound().build();
    }
}
```
*Intermediate layers wrap and rethrow without logging; the boundary handler logs the full chain exactly once.*

